                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This visual novel with adventure game elements by NLB project is a parody of the classic children's fairy tale where an unnamed boy tries to tell a bedtime story of Little Red Riding Hood to his younger sister to get her to sleep at night. As a young teenage girl Little Red Riding Hood, she lives with her mother and receives a task by her mother to gather ingredients to make a basket of apple, mushroom, cabbage, meat or fish pastries to deliver to her grandmother who is a forester and lives alone in a cottage inside a forest. \n\nAfter making the pastries, the game will transition to the visual novel part of the game where Red Riding Hood or her mother will deliver the pastries to their grandmother and encounter the Big Bad Wolf and also possibly encounter a group of woodcutters along the way with up to 50 different comedic, tragic and tragicomic endings.\n\n░░██▄░░░░░░░░░░▄██░░\n░▄▀░█▄░░░░░░░░▄█░░█░\n░█░▄░█▄░░░░░░▄█░▄░█░\n░█░██████████████▄█░\n░█████▀▀████▀▀█████░\n▄█▀█▀░░░████░░░▀▀███\n██░░▀████▀▀████▀░░██\n██░░░░█▀░░░░▀█░░░░██\n███▄░░░░░░░░░░░░▄███\n░▀███▄░░████░░▄███▀░\n░░░▀██▄░▀██▀░▄██▀░░░\n░░░░░░▀██████▀░░░░░░\n░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░\n\nHaving played this game for around a couple of hours to get all 50 endings, the scriptwriter of this visual novel has a very funny imagination where some of the endings are expected in which the Big Bad Wolf devoured Red Riding Hood, her mother and/or her grandmother.\n\nAmong a few of the more funny and unexpected endings, there are Red Riding Hood's widowed mother marrying the woodcutter, the Big Bad Wolf became a pet/friend of Red Riding Hood and her family members, the Big Bad Wolf starved and didn't eat anything, one or more characters including the Big Bad Wolf got the runs from food poisoning, Red Riding Hood's grandmother mistook Red Riding Hood as a werewolf and chased her out with a rolling pin to the Big Bad Wolf turning into a handsome prince and marrying Red Riding Hood when she is older or another girl.\n\nThe game has nice artwork(the 3D model of the Big Bad Wolf was comical and brought out the humour in the story) and classical background music. Recommended when at discount or bundle offer for those who like a short visual novel with many tragic and comedic twists to the classic fairy tale with easy achievements(a published community guide is available at the time of this review).",
